# the emulator with no debugger in it: a window, a pad, sound and the settings a person playing a
# game wants. Built with a ROM inside it by
#
#     haxelib run hx68k player <rom.bin>
#
# which adds -resource. Built plain, it takes a ROM path on the command line. Nothing reachable
# from here imports hx68k.map, and nothing under hx68k.debug but Row, which the widget layer holds
# a table of; the gate checks both against the sources this generates.
-cp src
-main hx68k.host.Player
-cpp ../export/md/player/obj

# the same three the debugger is built with
-D analyzer-optimize
-D HXCPP_OPTIMIZE_LINK
-D HXCPP_GC_GENERATIONAL
